"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n          현대 문명의 공급망이 일시에 정지하고 도구가 소멸했을 때, 인간이 맨손과 자연물만으로 생명을 보존하고 문명의 불씨를 다시 지필 수 있도록 고안된 무도구 야전 공학 기록서입니다. 허구적 민간요법을 배제하고 오직 현장 검증과 기초 물리학 법칙에 기초한 생존 지침만을 취급합니다.\n        </p>\n</div>\n<!-- 4 Quick Telemetry Badges Matrix -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-space-xs pt-space-xs\">\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">TOOL METRIC</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold mt-1\">[TOOL DEPENDENCY: 0.00%]</div>\n<div class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">공산품 일체 배제</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">CIVILIZATION TIER</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold mt-1\">[TIERS: PRIMITIVE → BRONZE]</div>\n<div class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">구석기부터 야금술까지</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">NETWORK STATUS</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold mt-1\">[OFFLINE: 100% PERSISTENT]</div>\n<div class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">서버 통신 의존성 영구 제로</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">LEGAL DISPOSITION</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold mt-1\">[LICENSING: CC0 PUBLIC DOMAIN]</div>\n<div class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">전 인류 무상 열람 및 복제</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 02 4-PILLAR E-E-A-T VERIFICATION DOCTRINE -->\n<section class=\"space-y-space-md\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between border-b border-outline-variant pb-space-sm gap-2\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">[DOCTRINE FRAMEWORK // E-E-A-T]</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary uppercase\">4대 엄격 실증 체계 (FOUR PILLARS OF RIGOR)</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\">\n          AUDIT ENGINE: HUMAN FIELD TEST + VECTOR PHYSICS + RED TEAM\n        </div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2x2 Tactical Grid -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\">\n<!-- PILLAR 01 -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"p-space-md border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold\">PILLAR 01 // PRIMITIVE ZERO-TOOL</span>\n<span class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-space-xs py-0.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">\n              RULE 01-A\n            </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-space-md space-y-space-sm flex-1\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary\">\n              100% 원시 자연물 고증 (ZERO-TOOL REPRODUCIBILITY)\n            </h3>\n<div class=\"border-l border-outline-variant pl-space-sm space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase\">Core Imperative:</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface\">\n                라이터, 페트병, 파라코드(나일론 끈), 건전지, 조리용 은박지, 금속 칼 등 현대 공산품 유입 전면 배제.\n              </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-t border-outline-variant/60 pt-space-sm space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">Technical Specification:</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n                오직 산림과 계곡에서 채집 가능한 원목, 깬 규암/흑요석, 칡덩굴 섬유, 찰흙, 잿물, 숯가루만을 원료로 채택합니다. 재난 조난 1일차 야영 구축부터 10년차 장기 거주지 설립까지 원시 도구 제작 재현성을 100% 보장합니다.\n              </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-space-md py-space-xs border-t border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline flex justify-between\">\n<span>METRIC: MATERIAL REPRODUCIBILITY</span>\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">100.0% PURE NATURE</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- PILLAR 02 -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"p-space-md border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold\">PILLAR 02 // VECTOR BLUEPRINT AUDIT</span>\n<span class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-space-xs py-0.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">\n              RULE 02-B\n            </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-space-md space-y-space-sm flex-1\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary\">\n              수석 공학자 &amp; 비전 AI 5대 루브릭 검증 (PHYSICS AUDIT)\n            </h3>\n<div class=\"border-l border-outline-variant pl-space-sm space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase\">Core Imperative:</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface\">\n                흐릿하고 주관적인 연출 사진을 전면 폐기하고, 1:1 기하학 치수선, 인장 벡터, 열역학 단면을 갖춘 정밀 SVG 청사진만 발행.\n              </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-t border-outline-variant/60 pt-space-sm space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">Technical Specification:</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n                마찰 발화 시 회전축 마찰계수(μ), 서까래 결구부 허용 하중(kgf), 끓는점 및 비등 소독 열역학 공식(Rolling Boil Kinetics)을 공학적으로 정량화하여 오차율 0%의 물리적 유효성을 감사 통과한 내용만 등재합니다.\n              </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-space-md py-space-xs border-t border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline flex justify-between\">\n<span>METRIC: STRUCTURAL ENGINEERING</span>\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">STRESS TEST AUDITED</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- PILLAR 03 -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"p-space-md border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold\">PILLAR 03 // 5-DIMENSION POSTING REVIEW</span>\n<span class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-space-xs py-0.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">\n              RULE 03-C\n            </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-space-md space-y-space-sm flex-1\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary\">\n              5차원 안전 레드팀 및 다면 사후 평가 (SAFETY PROTOCOL)\n            </h3>\n<div class=\"border-l border-outline-variant pl-space-sm space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase\">Core Imperative:</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface\">\n                단 하나의 치명적 독성/골절/저체온증 사고도 허용하지 않는 사전 Red-Team 모의 침투 및 생체 위해성 평가.\n              </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-t border-outline-variant/60 pt-space-sm space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">Technical Specification:</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n                모든 매뉴얼은 5단계 필수 인증 관문을 거칩니다: [01 생체 안전성] [02 시각·청각·촉각 오감 재현성] [03 학술 논문 E-E-A-T 검증] [04 7개국어 번역 표준화] [05 글로벌 법무·의료 규격 심의]. 단 1개 항목 결함 시 발행 영구 거부.\n              </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-space-md py-space-xs border-t border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline flex justify-between\">\n<span>METRIC: RED-TEAM REJECTION RATE</span>\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">78.4% HIGH-BARRIER</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- PILLAR 04 -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div class=\"p-space-md border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container flex justify-between items-center\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold\">PILLAR 04 // PWA ZERO-NET PERSISTENCE</span>\n<span class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-space-xs py-0.5 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">\n              RULE 04-D\n            </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-space-md space-y-space-sm flex-1\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary\">\n              완전 통신 두절 환경 100% 오프라인 작동 (DETERMINISTIC PWA)\n            </h3>\n<div class=\"border-l border-outline-variant pl-space-sm space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase\">Core Imperative:</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface\">\n                원격지 서버 의존도 0%. 단 1회 브라우저 접속으로 IndexedDB 및 Service Worker Cache에 영구 하드코딩 저장.\n              </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-t border-outline-variant/60 pt-space-sm space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">Technical Specification:</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n                EMP 전자기 펄스 공격, 해저 광케이블 절단, 정전 및 기지국 파괴 상황에서도 비행기 모드 상태로 전체 청사진과 매뉴얼이 0.01초 내 즉각 응답합니다. 자바스크립트 프레임워크 오버헤드를 배제한 경량화 아키텍처.\n              </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"px-space-md py-space-xs border-t border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline flex justify-between\">\n<span>METRIC: OFFLINE READINESS</span>\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">DETERMINISTIC CACHED</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 03 EDITORIAL TEAM & VERIFICATION COMMITTEE -->\n<section class=\"space-y-space-md\">\n<div class=\"border-b border-outline-variant pb-space-sm\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">[E-E-A-T AUTHORSHIP // VERIFICATION COMMITTEE]</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary uppercase\">수석 편찬 및 현장 검증 위원회</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\">\n<!-- CARD 1: FIELD ARCHEOLOGY -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low p-space-md md:p-space-lg space-y-space-md\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between border-b border-outline-variant pb-space-sm\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">CODE: LEAD-EXPEDITION-01</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1\">\n                야전 탐사 및 원시 인류학 수석 연구관\n              </h3>\n<p class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Field Reconnaissance &amp; Primitive Archaeology Lead</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary\">hardware</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-space-sm\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">OPERATIONAL BACKGROUND &amp; CLEARANCE</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface mt-1 leading-relaxed\">\n                구석기 및 신석기 원시 도구 제작 실증 20년. 극한지(동토/아열대 밀림) 무도구 단독 생존 120일 연속 검증 총괄 책임자. 전세계 고고학 발굴지 출토 석기 마이크로웨어(마모흔) 패턴 데이터베이스 구축.\n              </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase block font-semibold mb-1\">\n                VERIFICATION DOCTRINE PRINCIPLE:\n              </span>\n<blockquote class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface italic border-l-2 border-primary pl-space-sm\">\n                \"실제 자연 상태에서 맨손으로 원목을 베어 마찰열로 불을 피우고, 안전한 생수를 결로로 취득하지 못한 미검증 이론은 단 한 줄도 이 교범에 기록하지 않는다.\"\n              </blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-space-xs pt-space-xs font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline border-t border-outline-variant\">\n<div>EXPEDITION: <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">120+ DAYS</span></div>\n<div>FIELD TESTS: <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">480 CASES</span></div>\n<div>SURVIVAL RATE: <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">100.0%</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- CARD 2: MECHANICAL & BIOCHEMICAL -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low p-space-md md:p-space-lg space-y-space-md\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between border-b border-outline-variant pb-space-sm\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">CODE: LEAD-PHYSICS-02</span>\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1\">\n                기계 공학 및 생체 화학 검증 위원\n              </h3>\n<p class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\">Mechanical Blueprint &amp; Biochemical Thermodynamics Lead</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary\">square_foot</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-space-sm\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">OPERATIONAL BACKGROUND &amp; CLEARANCE</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface mt-1 leading-relaxed\">\n                공학 박사(열역학 전공). 활비비(Bow Drill) 마찰 발화 열량 해석, 목질부 수종별 파단 계수(Modulus of Rupture) 구조 공학 시뮬레이션, 참나무 건류 열분해(Pyrolysis) 숯 제조 및 수질 정화 동역학 모델링.\n              </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase block font-semibold mb-1\">\n                VERIFICATION DOCTRINE PRINCIPLE:\n              </span>\n<blockquote class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface italic border-l-2 border-primary pl-space-sm\">\n                \"자연 법칙에 위배되는 민간요법을 철저히 배제하고, 열역학 전달 방정식과 병원성 미생물 사멸 동역학(Kill Kinetics)으로 생존과 치유의 가능성을 수학적으로 증명한다.\"\n              </blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-space-xs pt-space-xs font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline border-t border-outline-variant\">\n<div>STRESS MODELS: <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">1,240 SIMS</span></div>\n<div>PATHOGEN D/V: <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">6-LOG RED</span></div>\n<div>CAD ACCURACY: <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">±0.05 mm</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 04 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS & OPEN SOURCE MANIFESTO -->\n<section class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md md:p-space-xl space-y-space-lg\">\n<div class=\"border-b border-outline-variant pb-space-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">[INFRASTRUCTURE // ARCHITECTURAL SPECS]</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary uppercase\">기술 사양 및 오픈소스 배포 헌장</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary px-space-xs py-1 border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-high\">\n          DISTRIBUTION MODEL: PUBLIC DOMAIN INFRASTRUCTURE\n        </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-space-md\">\n<!-- SPEC 1 -->\n<div class=\"space-y-space-xs border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-space-md\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">menu_book</span>\n            01 // DATA ARCHITECTURE (SSOT)\n          </div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n            Git 기반의 단일 진실 공급원(Single Source of Truth) 체계. \n          </p>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">\n            모든 청사진과 지침은 정형화된 JSON Schema와 일반 텍스트 Markdown으로 영구 보존됩니다. 독점 포맷 소프트웨어 없이도 50년 후 구형 단말기에서 즉각 파싱 가능합니다.\n          </p>\n</div>\n<!-- SPEC 2 -->\n<div class=\"space-y-space-xs border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-space-md\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">monitor_heart</span>\n            02 // HUMANITARIAN CC0 LICENSE\n          </div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n            MIT / Creative Commons Zero (CC0) 인류 공용 도메인.\n          </p>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">\n            상업적 저작권 장벽 없이 전 인류가 무상으로 복사, 인쇄, 번역, 개작 및 오프라인 배포할 수 있습니다. 지식의 독점은 재난 상황에서 살인과 같습니다.\n          </p>\n</div>\n<!-- SPEC 3 -->\n<div class=\"space-y-space-xs border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-space-md\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">print</span>\n            03 // FIELD PRINT READINESS\n          </div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n            잉크 절약형 초고대비 모노크롬 (A4/Letter Pocket Guide).\n          </p>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">\n            모든 도표는 흑백 레이저 프린터 및 복사기에서 번짐 없이 100% 식별 가능한 단색 벡터 선화로 렌더링되며, 원클릭 비상 인쇄용 PDF 출력을 기본 탑재합니다.\n          </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Live Ledger Log -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low font-label-sm text-label-sm\">\n<div class=\"p-space-sm border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container flex justify-between items-center text-primary font-semibold\">\n<span>SYSTEM INTEGRITY &amp; DISPERSAL REGISTRY</span>\n<span>BUILD: 2024.11-RELEASE-LTS</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"divide-y divide-outline-variant/40\">\n<div class=\"p-space-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-1 hover:bg-surface-container-high\">\n<span class=\"text-on-surface\">CORE_PROTOCOL_SHA256: 7f83b1657ff1fc53b92dc18148a1d65dfc2d4b1fa3d677284addd200126d9069</span>\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">[VERIFIED]</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-space-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-1 hover:bg-surface-container-high\">\n<span class=\"text-on-surface\">OFFLINE_BUNDLE_SIZE: 24.81 MB (ALL SCHEMATICS + FULL HIGH-RES VECTORS INCLUDED)</span>\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">[CACHED]</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p-space-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-1 hover:bg-surface-container-high\">\n<span class=\"text-on-surface\">INTERNET_ACCESS_REQUIRED: FALSE (0 EXTERNAL API CALLS ON RUNTIME)</span>\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">[AIR-GAPPED PASS]</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>";

export const PRIVACY_MAIN_CONTENT = "<main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-margin-desktop py-space-lg space-y-space-xl\">\n<!-- DOCUMENT HERO SECTION -->\n<section class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 relative overflow-hidden technical-grid\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-between items-start gap-4\">\n<div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container px-2.5 py-1\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-amber-500 text-[14px]\">verified_user</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface uppercase tracking-wider font-bold\">\n            REGULATORY COMPLIANCE PROTOCOL // PRIVACY-SPEC-2026.10\n          </span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline border border-outline-variant px-2 py-1 bg-surface-dim\">\n          REVISION: POST-COLLAPSE DOCTRINE v2.4\n        </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">\n<h1 class=\"font-headline-xl text-headline-xl md:text-headline-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary uppercase\">\n          ZERO PERSONAL DATA HARVESTING DOCTRINE\n        </h1>\n<p class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-secondary\">\n          개인 식별 정보 제로 수집 헌장 및 오프라인 생존 로컬 텔레메트리 보증서\n        </p>\n</div>\n<!-- MISSION STATEMENT BOX -->\n<div class=\"border-l-2 border-primary bg-surface-container-low p-4 md:p-5\">\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase text-primary font-bold mb-1\">\n          [CRITICAL MANIFESTO // 핵심 선언문]\n        </div>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n          본 생존 교범(SURVIVAL PROTOCOL // DOC-089)은 대규모 전력망 붕괴, 통신 두절, 극단적 비상 재난 환경에서도 인간의 생존을 지원하기 위해 설계된 오프라인 퍼스트 공공 매뉴얼입니다. 본 프로토콜은 <strong>철저한 Zero-PII(개인식별정보 제로) 원칙</strong>에 따라 구축되었습니다. \n          어떠한 형태의 회원가입, 실명, 주민등록번호, 연락처, 기기 고유 식별자, 결제 정보도 일체 요구하거나 수집·저장하지 않습니다. 귀하의 디지털 익명성은 시스템 수준에서 100% 영구 보장됩니다.\n        </p>\n</div>\n<!-- 4-BOX TELEMETRY SPECIFICATION MATRIX -->\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pt-2\" id=\"matrix\">\n<!-- Metric 1 -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">INDEX 01 // METRIC</div>\n<div class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-2\">[PII: 0.00%]</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold mb-1\">식별 정보 수집 전무</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">계정, 실명, 연락처, 암호 등 사용자 신원 데이터를 원천 수집하지 않음.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-outline-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">\n            STATUS: ACTIVE ENFORCED\n          </div>\n</div>\n<!-- Metric 2 -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">INDEX 02 // ARCHITECTURE</div>\n<div class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold mb-2\">[LOCAL FIRST]</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold mb-1\">로컬 샌드박스 격리</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">체크리스트, 매듭법 완료 여부 등 모든 데이터는 브라우저 내부 IndexedDB/Cache에만 격리.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-outline-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">\n            STORAGE: AIR-GAPPED\n          </div>\n</div>\n<!-- Metric 3 -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">INDEX 03 // AD NETWORK</div>\n<div class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-amber-400 font-bold mb-2\">[ADSENSE &amp; GA4]</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold mb-1\">광고 규정 및 통계 준수</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">구글 게시자 정책 및 애드센스 규정을 준수하며 제3자 쿠키 거부권 완벽 제공.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-outline-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">\n            AUDIT: GOOGLE COMPLIANT\n          </div>\n</div>\n<!-- Metric 4 -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-4 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">INDEX 04 // JURISDICTION</div>\n<div class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold mb-2\">[GDPR / PWA SPEC]</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold mb-1\">글로벌 법적 권리 보장</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">EU GDPR, 캘리포니아 CCPA 및 대한민국 개인정보보호법 기반 열람·삭제권 보장.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-4 pt-2 border-t border-outline-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">\n            REVOCATION: INSTANT\n          </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- SECTION 01: GOOGLE ADSENSE & THIRD-PARTY COOKIES -->\n<article class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest\" id=\"adsense\">\n<header class=\"border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container px-4 md:px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-primary text-surface-container-lowest font-bold\">SEC-01</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary uppercase font-bold tracking-tight\">\n            GOOGLE ADSENSE &amp; THIRD-PARTY COOKIES (구글 애드센스 맞춤형 광고 및 제3자 쿠키 규정)\n          </h2>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">[STATUS: MONITORED]</span>\n</header>\n<div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6\">\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n          본 플랫폼은 서버 호스팅 유지 비용 및 오프라인 배포 CDN 대역폭 비용을 충당하기 위해 Google AdSense를 이용할 수 있습니다. \n          Google을 포함한 제3자 공급업체는 사용자가 본 웹사이트 또는 다른 웹사이트를 이전에 방문한 정보를 바탕으로 맞춤형 광고를 게재하기 위해 쿠키(Cookie)를 사용합니다.\n        </p>\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase font-bold border-l-2 border-outline pl-2\">\n            광고 개인 최적화 및 제3자 공급업체 고지 (Google Publisher Policies)\n          </div>\n<ul class=\"space-y-2 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant list-none pl-0\">\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">▪</span>\n<span><strong>광고 쿠키 사용:</strong> Google의 광고 쿠키를 통해 Google 및 그 파트너는 귀하의 방문 기록을 기반으로 관련성 높은 비상 물자 안내 및 일반 상업 광고를 표시할 수 있습니다.</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">▪</span>\n<span><strong>제3자 광고 네트워크:</strong> Google 공인 제3자 공급업체 또는 광고 네트워크의 쿠키 역시 트래픽 측정 및 광고 노출을 위해 활용될 수 있습니다.</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\">\n<span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">▪</span>\n<span><strong>쿠키 거부권 (Opt-Out Protocol):</strong> 귀하는 언제든지 개인 맞춤 광고 수신을 거부할 수 있으며, 이 경우 일반 비맞춤형 광고만 노출됩니다.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<!-- TECHNICAL COOKIE SPECIFICATION TABLE -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low overflow-x-auto\">\n<table class=\"w-full text-left font-body-sm text-body-sm border-collapse\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary uppercase\">\n<th class=\"p-3\">식별자 (Cookie Key)</th>\n<th class=\"p-3\">공급자</th>\n<th class=\"p-3\">목적 및 기능</th>\n<th class=\"p-3\">보존 기간</th>\n<th class=\"p-3\">차단 및 거부 프로토콜</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"divide-y divide-outline-variant font-label-md text-label-md\">\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-surface-container transition-none\">\n<td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-primary font-mono\">_gads, _gac_gb</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface\">Google LLC</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface-variant\">광고 게재 빈도 제어 및 광고 사기 방지</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface\">최대 13개월</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-400\">구글 광고 설정 차단 가능</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-surface-container transition-none\">\n<td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-primary font-mono\">IDE / DSID</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface\">Doubleclick.net</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface-variant\">타사 도메인 간 타겟팅 광고 및 전환 분석</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface\">1년 (갱신형)</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-400\">AboutAds.info 옵트아웃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"hover:bg-surface-container transition-none\">\n<td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-primary font-mono\">_ga, _ga_*</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface\">Google Analytics</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface-variant\">익명 트래픽 통계 및 이탈률 계산</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-on-surface\">2년 (비식별화)</td>\n<td class=\"p-3 text-emerald-400\">GA 차단 브라우저 부가기능</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<!-- OPT-OUT EXTERNAL ROUTE ACTIONS -->\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2\">\n<a class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:border-primary text-primary px-4 py-2 font-label-md text-label-md uppercase transition-none inline-flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"https://adssettings.google.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>[EXECUTE] GOOGLE ADS SETTINGS (맞춤 광고 차단)</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">open_in_new</span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high hover:border-primary text-primary px-4 py-2 font-label-md text-label-md uppercase transition-none inline-flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"https://www.aboutads.info/choices\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>[EXECUTE] ABOUTADS.INFO OPT-OUT (제3자 광고 집합 거부)</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\">open_in_new</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- SECTION 02: GOOGLE ANALYTICS 4 & ANONYMIZED TRAFFIC -->\n<article class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest\" id=\"telemetry\">\n<header class=\"border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container px-4 md:px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-primary text-surface-container-lowest font-bold\">SEC-02</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary uppercase font-bold tracking-tight\">\n            GOOGLE ANALYTICS 4 &amp; ANONYMIZED TRAFFIC (GA4 익명 트래픽 통계 규정)\n          </h2>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">[IP ANONYMIZATION: TRUE]</span>\n</header>\n<div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 space-y-5\">\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n          SURVIVAL PROTOCOL은 비상 상황 시 어떤 생존 기술 문서가 가장 많이 조회되는지, 정전 시 어떤 디바이스(스마트폰 저전력 브라우저, 전자책 단말기, 데스크톱)로 트래픽이 유입되는지 파악하기 위해 Google Analytics 4(GA4)를 제한적으로 가동합니다.\n        </p>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low p-4 space-y-2\">\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-400 text-[16px]\">security</span>\n              수집 목적 (Technical Telemetry)\n            </div>\n<ul class=\"text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant space-y-1 list-disc pl-4\">\n<li>국가/지역별 위기 발생 시 생존 매뉴얼 트래픽 폭주 모니터링</li>\n<li>대역폭 과부하 방지 및 서버 로드밸런싱 최적화</li>\n<li>평균 체류 시간 및 문서 가독성 검증</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low p-4 space-y-2\">\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-400 text-[16px]\">lock</span>\n              기술적 안전 조치 (Technical Safeguards)\n            </div>\n<ul class=\"text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant space-y-1 list-disc pl-4\">\n<li><strong>IP Anonymization:</strong> 전송 즉시 마지막 옥텟(Octet) 마스킹 처리</li>\n<li>사용자 식별자(User-ID) 비활성화 및 기기 지문 채취(Fingerprinting) 금지</li>\n<li>Google 신호 기반 데이터(Google Signals) 수집 기능 비활성화</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- SECTION 03: FIREBASE REALTIME TELEMETRY -->\n<article class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest\">\n<header class=\"border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container px-4 md:px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-primary text-surface-container-lowest font-bold\">SEC-03</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary uppercase font-bold tracking-tight\">\n            FIREBASE REALTIME TELEMETRY (익명 카운터 및 생존 확인 지표)\n          </h2>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">[STATELESS COUNTER]</span>\n</header>\n<div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4\">\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n          본 플랫폼의 문서별 [생존 확인 완료] 버튼 및 실시간 열람 카운터는 Google Cloud Firebase Realtime Database의 단방향 원자적 증분(Atomic Numeric Increment) 트랜잭션으로 작동합니다.\n        </p>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-4 font-mono text-body-sm space-y-2 text-on-surface\">\n<div class=\"text-outline font-label-sm text-label-sm\">// FIREBASE TELEMETRY PAYLOAD SCHEMA</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary\">{</div>\n<div class=\"pl-4 text-emerald-400\">\"document_id\": \"DOC-089-RIGGING\",</div>\n<div class=\"pl-4 text-emerald-400\">\"timestamp\": 1774849200,</div>\n<div class=\"pl-4 text-emerald-400\">\"verified_survivors_count\": \"+1\"</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary\">}</div>\n<div class=\"text-outline font-label-sm text-label-sm\">// 클라이언트 IP, 쿠키, 하드웨어 UUID 등 메타데이터 일체 누락 전송</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">\n          이 데이터베이스 트랜잭션에는 클라이언트 캔버스 해시, 브라우저 글꼴 스택, 그래픽 카드 WebGL 벤더 등의 기기 고유 핑거프린팅 메타데이터가 일체 첨부되지 않으며, 서버 측에 어떠한 로그도 적재되지 않습니다.\n        </p>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- SECTION 04: PWA LOCAL STORAGE & CLIENT-SIDE CACHING -->\n<article class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest\" id=\"storage\">\n<header class=\"border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container px-4 md:px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-primary text-surface-container-lowest font-bold\">SEC-04</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary uppercase font-bold tracking-tight\">\n            PWA LOCAL STORAGE &amp; AIR-GAPPED CACHING (오프라인 캐시 및 브라우저 로컬 저장소)\n          </h2>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">[HARDWARE RESIDENCY: 100%]</span>\n</header>\n<div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6\">\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n          SURVIVAL PROTOCOL은 전자기 펄스(EMP) 또는 통신망 물리 단절 상태를 대비하여 Progressive Web App (PWA) 기술로 구동됩니다. \n          따라서 모든 필수 교범, 매듭법 벡터 청사진, 체크리스트 진행률, 비상 의약품 계산 결과는 사용자의 단말기 내부 저장소(LocalStorage 및 Cache Storage API)에만 물리적으로 저장됩니다.\n        </p>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3\">\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-4\">\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold uppercase mb-1\">LOCALSTORAGE</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-emerald-400 mb-2\">[AIR-GAPPED SCOPE]</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">체크리스트 체크 여부, 사용자 화면 밝기 설정(HUD Night Mode), 계산기 임시 입력값.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-4\">\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold uppercase mb-1\">SERVICE WORKER</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-emerald-400 mb-2\">[OFFLINE ROUTING]</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">인터넷 단절 감지 시 즉각 로컬 캐시 라우팅 모드로 자동 전환하여 무제한 오프라인 열람 보장.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container p-4\">\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold uppercase mb-1\">CACHE STORAGE</div>\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-emerald-400 mb-2\">[STATIC VECTOR BLUEPRINTS]</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">폰트, SVG 테크니컬 드로잉, 응급 수술 매뉴얼 정적 에셋의 무손실 로컬 보관.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-l-2 border-amber-500 bg-surface-container-low p-4 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface\">\n<strong>외부 전송 불가 보증 (Exfiltration Zero):</strong> \n          귀하의 단말기 브라우저에 저장된 생존 매뉴얼의 진행 기록과 설정값은 외부 중앙 서버로 재전송되거나 싱크되지 않습니다. 귀하가 브라우저를 닫거나 단말기를 파기하면 해당 기록은 완벽히 소멸됩니다.\n        </div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- SECTION 05: DATA SUBJECT RIGHTS & HARD PURGE -->\n<article class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest\" id=\"rights\">\n<header class=\"border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container px-4 md:px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-primary text-surface-container-lowest font-bold\">SEC-05</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary uppercase font-bold tracking-tight\">\n            DATA SUBJECT RIGHTS &amp; HARD PURGE (이용자의 권리 및 데이터 삭제·거부권)\n          </h2>\n</div>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-emerald-400\">[RIGHT TO ERASURE]</span>\n</header>\n<div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6\">\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n          귀하는 대한민국 개인정보보호법 제35조~제37조, EU GDPR 제17조(잊힐 권리/삭제권), 캘리포니아 CCPA에 의거하여 당 플랫폼에 저장된 로컬 데이터 및 캐시를 언제든지 열람, 거부, 즉각 삭제할 권리가 있습니다. \n          중앙 수집 서버가 없으므로 별도의 고객센터 승인 절차 없이, 귀하는 본 화면에서 단 1회의 물리적 클릭으로 로컬 샌드박스를 완벽 파기할 수 있습니다.\n        </p>\n<!-- HARD PURGE INTERACTIVE MODULE -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline bg-surface-container-low p-5 space-y-4\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n<div class=\"space-y-1\">\n<div class=\"font-label-md text-label-md uppercase text-primary font-bold flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-rose-500 text-[18px]\">delete_forever</span>\n                클라이언트 로컬 캐시 및 브라우저 세션 영구 파기 (HARD PURGE TRIGGER)\n              </div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\">\n                클릭 시 본 브라우저에 적재된 LocalStorage, SessionStorage 및 서비스 워커 Cache Registry를 즉각 포맷합니다.\n              </p>\n</div>\n<button class=\"border border-rose-600 bg-surface text-rose-400 hover:bg-rose-600 hover:text-black font-label-md text-label-md font-bold px-5 py-3 uppercase tracking-wider transition-none flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shrink-0\" id=\"purgeBtn\" onclick=\"executeHardPurge()\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\">dangerous</span>\n<span>[로컬 데이터 즉각 초기화 (PURGE STORAGE)]</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hidden p-3 border border-emerald-500 bg-surface-dim font-label-sm text-label-sm text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-2\" id=\"purgeStatus\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">check_circle</span>\n<span>STATUS: ALL CLIENT-SIDE STORAGE &amp; LOCAL DATA ERASED SUCCESSFULLY. SYSTEM STANDBY.</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- DATA CONTROLLER & PHYSICAL HOSTING INFRASTRUCTURE -->\n<section class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6\">\n<div class=\"border-b border-outline-variant pb-3 flex justify-between items-center\">\n<h3 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary uppercase font-bold\">\n          DATA CONTROLLER &amp; TECHNICAL DISCLOSURE (책임자 및 호스팅 인프라)\n        </h3>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline\">[OPEN REPOSITORY]</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-body-sm text-body-sm\">\n<div class=\"space-y-2 border-l border-outline-variant pl-4\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">01 // DATA PROTECTION OFFICER</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary font-bold\">생존 프로토콜 익명성 감독관</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface-variant font-mono\">CHANNEL: privacy@survival-protocol.com</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">GDPR Art. 37 &amp; 대한민국 개인정보보호책임자</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-2 border-l border-outline-variant pl-4\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">02 // PHYSICAL HOSTING NETWORK</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary font-bold\">Vercel Edge &amp; GitHub Pages</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">Anycast Global Edge Network / Serverless Runtime</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">미국 캘리포니아 및 전 세계 분산 CDN 노드</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-2 border-l border-outline-variant pl-4\">\n<div class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase\">03 // LEGAL DOCTRINE &amp; LICENSE</div>\n<div class=\"text-primary font-bold\">인도주의 비상 공공 저작물</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)</div>\n<div class=\"text-on-surface-variant\">재난 시 상업·비상업 무제한 복제 및 배포 승인</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- AIR-GAPPED VERIFICATION BADGE -->\n<div class=\"border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-3 font-label-sm text-label-sm\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 text-on-surface\">\n<span class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-emerald-500 inline-block\"></span>\n<span>SECURITY VERIFICATION: ZERO TRACKERS BEYOND DECLARED GOOGLE ADSENSE &amp; GA4.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-outline font-mono\">\n        NEXT AUDIT CYCLE: 2026.Q4 // PWA CACHE VERIFIED\n      </div>\n</div>\n</main>";

